<!-- App icon, and — because the engine falls back to `applicationInfo.icon`
     when `notification.smallIcon` is unset (BGGeoEngine.kt:544-551) — the
     foreground-service notification's small icon too.

     A module with no app icon at all is not merely cosmetic here:
     `applicationInfo.icon` is then 0, `startForeground` rejects the
     notification as iconless, and the system kills the process the moment
     tracking starts (`CannotPostForegroundServiceNotificationException`).

     Deliberately one flat silhouette: Android draws the vector as-is in the
     launcher, and uses only its alpha channel in the notification tray, so a
     single-path pin reads correctly in both places. -->
